<title>POLAND: ELEKTROMONTAZ NET FALLS IN APRIL.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROMONTAZ NET FALLS IN APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.25 vs   0.36</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.32 vs   0.41</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.27 vs   0.37</p>
<p> Sales		    4.66 vs   4.27</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.90 vs   0.89</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.32 vs   1.29</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.90 vs   1.22</p>
<p> Sales		   18.07 vs  14.91</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction firm is</p>
<p>Elektromontaz Warszawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
